# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — NEVER commit. Cloudflare / R2 credentials belong in env storage.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.dev.vars
.wrangler/
credentials.json
secrets.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large media — lives in Cloudflare R2, not in Git.
# Add explicit exceptions below if a small asset genuinely must be versioned.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi
*.mkv
*.m4v
*.psd
*.ai
*.zip
*.tar.gz
/media/
/public/media/
/assets/media/

# Owner-supplied source media. docs/Smash/ is 469 MB of masters and web exports —
# inventoried in docs/SMASH_MEDIA_INVENTORY.md, never committed.
# (The *.mp4 / *.mov rules above already cover it; this is belt and braces.)
/docs/Smash/
/media-staging/

# The local bucket mirror and the incoming drop, both covered by /media/ above.
# Named here so the rule is legible rather than incidental:
#   media/dist/       byte-identical to the R2 delivery bucket; rebuild with media:build
#   media/incoming/   where a new source file is dropped before it has a recipe entry
#   media/.*.json     encoder cache and the sync/backup ledgers

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Source preservation archive (scripts/archive-source.mjs).
# Byte-faithful copies of the live WordPress site: raw HTML, REST responses and
# 175 MB of media binaries. NEVER committed — but it is our only durable copy,
# so it must be backed up outside this repo. See docs/SOURCE_ARCHIVE.md.
# The *derived* JSON in docs/source-archive/ IS committed and is the record.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/source-archive/

# Fonts: the supplied TTF originals are OFL-licensed and small, so they stay in
# source-assets/fonts/. Built WOFF2 output is generated, not committed.
/src/assets/fonts/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Dependencies & build output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
dist/
build/
out/
.next/
.astro/
.output/
.vercel/
.cache/
*.tsbuildinfo

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Tooling / OS
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.idea/
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
coverage/
.eslintcache

# Disposable prototype media for the Review A concepts (scripts/build-concept-media.mjs).
# Regenerated on demand; never shipped, never committed.
/public/__generated/

# Generated WOFF2 binaries live under /public/__generated/ (already ignored above).
# src/styles/fonts.css IS committed: it is the record of which faces and which real
# usWeightClass values are declared, and a fresh clone must still build. Without the
# binaries the faces simply fall back to the system stack until build-fonts.mjs runs.
